!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares shore take-disk

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares shore take-disk]] also/[[lares shore keep-disk]] ~ the terminal; settling stays a hand act`>>
```

